<title>USA: Banyan Mortgage annual meeting adjourned.</title>
<headline>Banyan Mortgage annual meeting adjourned.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banyan Mortgage Investment Fund said its November 26 annual stockholders meeting was convened and adjourned to December 18.</p>
<p>On November 20, Banyan said it received an unsolicited proposal from Apollo Real Estate Advisors II LP to acquire all of Banyan Mortgage's shares for $0.46875 a share.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
